.jpg"},{"id":26918,"name":"Karl Walter Sprungala","role":"Shakespeare"},{"id":1203180,"name":"Menyhért René Balog-Dutombé","role":"Butler Millhouse"},{"id":1051839,"name":"Tilla Kratochwil","role":"Lady Brompton","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dlp5uFj0oP0rFd0HhSOzXVNdl4t.jpg"},{"id":1562738,"name":"Friederike Rhein","role":"Sarah Bloomberg"},{"id":576586,"name":"Christine Rollar","role":"Mrs. Jenkins","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kJLYwbtlsRViBPdYdwMhu523EgP.jpg"},{"id":1906782,"name":"Tim Vetter","role":"Angreifer der Allianz"},{"id":16716,"name":"Alister Mazzotti","role":"Angreifer der Allianz"},{"id":1327602,"name":"Martin Östreicher","role":"Lord Brompton"},{"id":586674,"name":"Butz Ulrich Buse","role":"Miro Rakoczy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bLIrSOzpSERMqNruxbJXdISmOQq.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Ruby Red II - Il segreto di Zaffiro","overview":"Gwendolyn Shepherd ha appena scoperto di essere il membro finale del Circolo dei Dodici, un gruppo segreto di viaggiatori nel tempo. Ancora non a suo agio nel nuovo ruolo, dovrà combattere contro le insidie del passato, rivedere la sua relazione con Gideon, confrontarsi con gli oscuri segreti che attorniano il gruppo dei Dodici e ricercare uno dei due cronografi segreti rubato da Lucy e Paul."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Sapphire Blue","overview":"Gwen has just discovered, that she's the final member of the secret time-traveling Circle of Twelve. Now she has to juggle with constant trips to the past, her relationships with Gideon and figuring out dark secrets surrounding the Circle."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Frisch verliebt in die Vergangenheit, das ist keine gute Idee. Das zumindest findet Gwendolyn Shepherd, Zeitreisende wider Willen. Schließlich haben sie und Gideon ganz andere Probleme. Zum Beispiel die Welt zu retten. Oder Menuett tanzen zu lernen. Beides nicht wirklich einfach! Als Gideon dann auch noch anfängt, sich völlig rätselhaft zu benehmen, wird Gwendolyn klar, dass sie schleunigst ihre Hormone in den Griff bekommen muss. Gut, dass sie wichtige Ratgeber an ihrer Seite weiß: Ihre beste Freundin Leslie, der kleine Wasserspeier Xemerius, der Schulgeist James und ihr Großvater in jungen Jahren, der ihr in der Vergangenheit wichtige Tipps gibt. Doch als Gideon und Gwendolyn sich gegen eine gefährliche Allianz zur Wehr setzen müssen und in die Fänge des Grafen von St. Germain geraten, wird ihre Liebe auf eine harte Probe gestellt.","tagline":"Liebe geht durch alle Zeiten!"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yt7MiIFW0bLRFdl2lwcdP4IZz3T.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yt7MiIFW0bLRFdl2lwcdP4IZz3T.png","language":"it","width":952,"height":227},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rNszr0WRW4J8CyrlgPgCQ8TKz8L.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rNszr0WRW4J8CyrlgPgCQ8TKz8L.png","language":"en","width":1278,"height":204},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rvZ37k4h0fbg9FhL95W9zKuka2N.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rvZ37k4h0fbg9FhL95W9zKuka2N.png","language":"de","width":1914,"height":337}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eV7FW9I3NenWtHL3XhRCw224v5M.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eV7FW9I3NenWtHL3XhRCw224v5M.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kxRqokSkj6HWuwVCbnddPFg73CM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kxRqokSkj6HWuwVCbnddPFg73CM.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Yh4UygK5CjxiARf3Av5OW3jiA7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7Yh4UygK5CjxiARf3Av5OW3jiA7.jpg","language":"de","width":922,"height":1303},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y4Zg